<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to announce July trade balance Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Brazil to announce July trade balance Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Ministry of Industry and Commerce will announce the trade balance for July at 1100 local/1000 EDT/1400 GMT Tuesday, a spokeswoman said on Monday.</p>
<p>Government sources have said the month brought a wider-than-expected $811 million deficit, which would take the gap for the year so far to $5.5 billion, equivalent to the trade deficit of the whole of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-3141193))</p>
